# Source inventory and immutable planning only. No discovery or model work.
name: Study engine choices are visible, scoped, reversible and finite
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR SEMGREP_APP_TOKEN SEMGREP_AGENT_TOKEN
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_engines.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/alpha-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 RESULT READY | imported-map
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Scan | accepted-map
keys: Escape
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 25 ACCEPTED SCOPES | accepted-scopes
keys: p
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | scoped-study
keys: Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE DISCOVERY ENGINES | engine-picker
expect: Automatic selection
expect: UNSUPPORTED
ask: Does the engine picker explain that the inherited automatic plan cannot honor the accepted scope, without replacing it or starting work?
keys: a
require-live-snap: 15 Selection needs attention | rejected-auto
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_engines.py @TMP_TARGET @ART picker
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 15 agentic | model-engine
keys: Space
require-live-snap: 15 Unsupported for this scope | unsupported-model
ask: Is unsupported scoped model work explained as a capability limit, with no silent switch to another model or broader scope?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: engines-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: engines-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: engines-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: engines-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: engines-40x12
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
live-snap: engines-small-paged
ask: At 40x12, can the operator reach the selected engine explanation and return without losing engine choices or approving jobs?
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
require-live-snap: 15 guarantee. | engines-small-last
ask: Can the complete explanation be read to its final resource guidance, with position and apply/cancel controls visible?
resize: 120x36
keys: Up Up Up Space
require-live-snap: 15 [x] secret-scan | selected-native
paste-file: @ART/ignored-paste.txt
live-snap: paste-owned
expect: [x] secret-scan
ask: Does multiline paste stay owned by the picker, leaving the selection and hidden composer intact?
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Engine choices updated | choices-applied
expect: Discovery engines  secret-scan
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE DISCOVERY ENGINES | reopen-picker
keys: Up Up Up Up Up Enter
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Discovery engines  secret-scan | canceled-draft
ask: Does canceling a second engine edit restore the applied study selection without changing global tool settings or launching work?
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | finite-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_engines.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
ask: Does preparing the study bind the chosen engine to three fixed jobs, with spending approval still separate?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 3 planned | restored-jobs
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | restored-study
expect: Discovery engines  secret-scan
keys: Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE DISCOVERY ENGINES | restored-engines
expect: [x] secret-scan
ask: After actual exit and no-color restart, are the saved engine choices and scope retained without running discovery or clearing spending history?
keys: a
require-live-snap: 15 Engine choices retained | unchanged-choices
expect: Source and context  frozen
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_engines.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
